  "body": "Some addresses are sought after for their setting. Others for the lifestyle they promise. The exceptional few offer both, together with the freedom to make a home entirely your own.\r\n\r\nJust four properties back from Devonport beach, welcome to an opportunity to secure your place in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods, where established surroundings, a relaxed seaside atmosphere and the convenience of village and city connections come together.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover the home from every perspective. The VIDEO TOUR introduces a light-filled residence with an easy, single level layout, established interiors and a natural connection to its surroundings. Comfortable as it stands, the home offers an inviting starting point for a range of lifestyles, with the flexibility to enjoy immediately or thoughtfully enhance over time.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 506sqm freehold site, the home enjoys an elevated position, framed by mature greenery and an appealing sense of privacy. An existing sea outlook from the front lawn provides a reminder of the coastal setting, while the generous grounds offer space to relax, entertain, garden or explore the possibilities for the future.\r\n\r\nInside, three bedrooms and two bathrooms are complemented by a practical, easy-flowing configuration designed around everyday comfort. The arrangement will appeal to those seeking effortless living, whether starting out, accommodating a growing family or looking to simplify without compromising on location. Light filled spaces and an established sense of home provide a welcoming foundation, with scope to introduce your own style and further enhance the residence.\r\n\r\nFor those with a more ambitious vision, the landholding and position present another dimension to the opportunity. There is potential to refresh and reimagine the existing home, with the possibility of further opening up the interiors and enhancing the coastal outlook, subject to the necessary council approvals. Existing plans are available upon request, offering a useful starting point for those wishing to explore what may be possible.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home itself, the position is a defining part of its appeal. Devonport's coastline, village and waterfront are woven into the rhythm of everyday life. Devonport Beach, Torpedo Bay and Cheltenham Beach are all within easy reach, alongside the waterfront promenade, boutique cafes, shopping, established premium schools and leafy reserves. The ferry provides a direct connection to Auckland's central business district, making the transition between seaside tranquillity and city life both effortless and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nIt is a neighbourhood where everyday pleasures come naturally. Morning walks along the waterfront, a coffee in the village, afternoons by the beach and the pleasure of returning home to an established coastal community. It is this enduring sense of place that has made Devonport so consistently sought after. It is a lifestyle that has retained its appeal across generations and continues to make this neighbourhood so sought-after.\r\n\r\nUltimately, it is the combination that distinguishes this property: an established home, generous freehold land, an elevated coastal setting and a coveted address. Whether you are looking to secure a lifestyle, create something more personal or invest in a location with enduring appeal, this is an opportunity with multiple dimensions and considerable scope for its next custodian.\r\n\r\nAn established home. An elevated coastal setting. And an address that will always be in demand.\r\n\r\nProudly marketed by The EK Group, delivering prestige, passion, and property without parallel.",
